    "title": "Mike Trout says Angels needed to make the moves they made - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Fletcher jlfletcher@scng.com ,\n6 hours ago BALTIMORE — Mike Trout remains willingly attached to a franchise that seemingly can’t get out of an endless loop of losing. After the Angels finally made a series of trades that no doubt set them back in the short term in the hopes of reversing the long-term trajectory, Trout remains undeterred. Read full article",
